  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "七种颜色的汽水能力可以混合、摇匀并组合成自定义鸡尾酒式构筑。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Choose from a variety of soda powers across 7 different colors, mix, shake, add a little dash of fury and create the freshest builds found in this side of the universe.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2178990/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "六个身体部位与三十多种义体改造共同构成分部位的角色定制系统。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "With six different body parts and over 30 cybernetic augments available for implementation, you'll have endless options for character customization.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2178990/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "Entity-X制造“汽水末日”让几乎所有汽水失去气泡，Sodaman因此踏上寻找幸存汽水的荒诞宇宙任务。",
      "dimension": "故事",
      "excerpt": "Sodaman is infuriated, ever since Entity-X caused the Sodacalypse, making almost all of the sodas in the existence go flat, becoming bland and tasteless with the press of a button. Yet there are still some out there, untouched by this catastrophe and it is up to Sodaman himself to find them.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2178990/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
